    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just the shame that's the worst part. i can't stand the thought of people seeing me like this—broken and begging for help just to survive. there's a certain kind of dignity in not letting things get this low, you know? like, instead of letting the crash destroy everything that's left of my reputation, there might be a way to just... control the exit. to end it while i still have some shred of self-respect left.",
